    "head_branch": "claude/run-phase-spec-35-7b-pdcvr5",
    "head_commit_message": "fix(test): the cunning batch of would-be players-dead gets its own store\n\ntest_with_a_foe_near_some_play_dead_and_the_cunning_more_often builds\ntwo batches of 40 with the same ids in one shared store, so each pair\nshared a slot. With WAKE_LEFT a column (spec 35 step 7b), the plain\nbatch's run overwrote the cunning batch's time downed and none of it\nplayed dead. A store of its own keeps the ids, and so the seeded rolls,\nthe test was tuned on.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Q4r1Pento9bfttpwCkibux",
